! Test-only canon laws (Law-Seeker: Lares (Tasked Spirit)) 2026-11-01

Method: read-only grep of tests/witnesses; the hook = .githooks/pre-commit -> meme-check-staged.sh (`lares meme check` over staged .mem blobs), submission-currency-staged.sh, repo-tunnel-staged.sh. Evergreen-boundary and witnesses are NOT in the hook. Probes: scratch copy of child-grade-decision.mem, one mutation each, re-stamped with normalize (scratch only), then `meme check` (scratch: /home/joshu/.lares-scratch/law-seek/). `meme check` today covers: frame/bcc re-stamp, normalize clauses (incl. bare `#slot` -> `#/slot`, auto-nesting of ahu), duplicate meta key, content after EOT, torn frame, checkCarrierLifecycle (stage-owes: open lean / fold target). It does NOT run &#45;-gradient/&#45;-edges/&#45;-grammar.

Reach: CI paths-ignore skips ALL of tests/witnesses/evergreen on a meme-only push (bags/**/*.mem, ''/*.md, wikis/'', CHANGELOG.md). So reach of every TEST-ONLY row = "a meme-only push is never judged; red surfaces on the next code push, if at all".

