!! TEST-ONLY list: placement, red/control

# status-why (+ closed stage vocabulary): `carrier-lifecycle.ts` checkCarrierLifecycle (already called by `meme check`); add "stage without status-why >=8" and "lifecycle/* tag outside the 5". Red: base.mem with status-why removed -> exit 1 `stage:` line. Control: ungoverned carrier (no lifecycle tag) and kind/rite stay exit 0. Test then imports the same function over carrierFiles.
# canon-history / canon-dated-history: new evergreen class `canon`, run from the hook over staged api|mesh|browser .mem (the classify() in evergreen-boundary.mjs is already pure per-file). Red: planted "used to ... landed 2026-09-01". Control: RULED-marked date, docs/ record carrier.
# s-vocabulary canon half: same hook seat (staged .mem through `memWords`). Red: "The VK rotation". Control: `ni:///sha-256;...VK...` content address.
# unquoted `lar:` positional: `meme check` rule (error-grade fault; quote-positionals.mjs already has the finder). Red <code>&lt;&lt;~ loulou lar:&#47;&#47;/x>></code>; control <code>&lt;&lt;~ loulou "lar:&#47;&#47;/x">></code>.
# DOCTYPE present, `type` = media type, closer spelling <code>&lt;&lt;~/name>></code>, `$` meta name, one body: fold into carrier-shape faults and make `meme check` fail on any shape fault of error grade (cheap: the check already reads readCarrierShape in &#45;-gradient). Red: each planted deletion above; control: base.mem.
# dangling edge on a STAGED carrier only: `--edges` over staged files vs HEAD (new naming-nothing edges refused). Whole-corpus empty-room stays CI-only.

Decision for operator: the hook runs the built CLI only; items 1-5 are pure per-file and cost no more than today's check.

